OL,3,GNEWSACat found stuck in dead man's home
OL,4,A'heartbreaking'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal rescue charity has said
OL,7,Ffinding a cat trapped in the home of a
OL,8,Fman who had died was "one of the most
OL,9,Fheartbreaking situations" it has had to
OL,10,Fdeal with.
OL,12,FStray Cat Rescue Team West Midlands
OL,13,Fsaid it was alerted by a friend of the
OL,14,Fman in Shrewsbury, who had died a
OL,15,Fcouple of weeks before he was
OL,16,Fdiscovered, a fortnight ago.
OL,18,FBut "Nibbles" had been left behind and
OL,19,Fwas unable to get out of the
OL,20,F"fly-ridden" property.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
