OL,3,GNEWSACat found stuck in dead man's home
OL,4,A'heartbreaking'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group said it rescued the cat and
OL,7,Fthat "somehow, against all the odds",
OL,8,Fit had survived for about a month, but
OL,9,Fit worried that other cats may be at
OL,10,Fsimilar risk.
